Description: Linux Edge native helper for RDP WebAuthn redirection
 Experimental native messaging helper and diagnostic probe for Microsoft Edge
 inside an xrdp desktop. Targets Ubuntu 24.04 amd64 and xrdp 0.9.24.
 Includes a private timeout-patched xrdp API library, not a system replacement.
 The browser extension is installed separately. Each desktop user must run
 edge-rdp-webauthn-setup inside their xrdp session after package installation.
